Tanglehorns are twisting horns that form a tight knot, occurring after the repeated sprouting of fresh horns. The hornsent valued them above all else as the truest sign of divinity. The Horned Warriors used them as conduits for Horn-Calling and divine invocation. Some worshippers ascended as tutelary deities or became conduits themselves for the Divine Beast to control.

Some of hornsent children were born blessed with an abundance of horns, and Horned Bairns were made to remember them after their untimely passing. This practice reemerged during the Age of the Erdtree when the first of the cursed Omen were born.
